<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDA VUURVAST 1996 NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>GOUDA VUURVAST 1996 NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>GOUDA, Netherlands 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     8.2  vs   5.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		 12.00 vs   8.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			     117.7  vs  86.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    12.3  vs   8.3</p>
<p>    Investments			    4.0  vs   3.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Gouda Vuurvast Holding NV said earlier this month it</p>
<p>expected a 1996 net profit of about 8.1 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
